DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTSTAMP:20261004T153041Z
UID:39b39d7c091218ad7268abd05896@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate fall at The Loom with seasonal drinks\, local vendor
 s\, festive activities\, and riverside views. Celebrate fall along the riv
 er at Fall Fest at The Loom Hotel! Join us on the Riverview Deck for an af
 ternoon of seasonal drinks\, local makers\, fall-inspired activities\, and
  some of our favorite Rhode Island businesses. Shop\, sip\, snack\, and di
 scover a curated lineup of local businesses\, including: Koncocted Bloom B
 ar Experience - Grab beautiful handcrafted bouquets or create your own wit
 h local Rhode Island-grown farm-fresh flowers &amp\; thrifted vases. Bijou
 x Brie Permanent Jewelry &#8211\; Find your new favorite piece with custom
 -fit permanent jewelry. Herbs and Mylk Luxury Botanical Skincare &#8211\; 
 Shop handcrafted botanical skincare and self-care favorites. Holiday by Na
 y &#8211\; Enjoy homemade baked goods by Danasia. Hammer and Stain by Craf
 ty Girls DIY &#8211\; A mobile craft business. Sammallas - Vintage and Han
 dmade Jewelry Come sip\, shop\, snack\, and support local while enjoying a
 n October afternoon by the river at The Loom. 🍂\n\nSource: https://www.
 visitrhodeisland.com/event/fall-fest-at-the-loom-hotel/111938/
LOCATION:The Loom Hotel Tapestry Collection by Hilton - Warwick\, 400 Knig
 ht Street\, Warwick\, RI 02886
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/fall-fest-at-the-loom-hotel/111
 938/
END:VEVENT
